            "detailed_description": "For a long, long time they have been bound by rules and assumptions. Trapped within the boundaries of signs. Until one day, the kid from the school crossing sign is thrown out – unleashing a new world – the world of Sign Motion. Where will the kid go now? Will others follow, help or oppose?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience mind-bending puzzles in a strange yet familiar world.",
